  "name": "Hedging Circle (Su)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Necromancer 6, Harm Touch class feature</p><p>The necromancer can use one of his uses of harm touch as a standard action to imprison undead within a protective circle (30-ft. radius centered within 30 ft. of him). Neither the creatures nor any spells and effects originating from them can cross the circle. This effect remains for a number of rounds equal to his Charisma modifier but dissipates if he attacks across the barrier.</p>",
